# Repo only files at this package root, kept out of the home directory. The generated
# manifest, the module level declaration, and the collector are the module's contract with
# the layer above, so they belong to the repository rather than to the running config, and
# check-timers is a check on the source that the running config has no use for. The
# declarations inside .hammerspoon are deliberately not listed, since the running config
# reads them, both the per spoon ones and the per file ones such as
# providers/mullvad.dependencies.
DEPENDENCIES
dependencies-module
dependencies-collect
check-timers

# lean-init.lua, beside init.lua inside .hammerspoon, is repo only test infrastructure the
# same way the manifest above is. bin/hs-devlock acquire --lean points MJConfigFile at it
# directly from the worktree, so resting main never needs it stowed into the home directory,
# and it stays out for the same reason the manifest does.
lean-init.lua
